{"last_link_id": 21, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#446688", "widgets_values": ["MiniMax H3 首尾帧视频工作流 (FLF2V + 运镜控制 + 质量控制)\n基于 ComfyUI 原生 MiniMax H3 节点，使用 fl2va 权重实现首尾帧视频生成\n\n【核心功能】\n  1. FLF2V: 上传首帧和尾帧，H3 自动生成中间过渡视频\n  2. 运镜控制: 通过提示词中的 Camera 段落描述运镜方式\n  3. 质量控制: SigmaShift + 分辨率 + 采样步数\n  4. 原生音频: H3 联合建模视频+音频，输出带音轨的 MP4\n\n【运镜控制指南 (通过提示词)】\n  在提示词的 Camera 段落中描述运镜方式：\n  • Zoom in (推镜头): Camera slowly pushes in toward the subject\n  • Zoom out (拉镜头): Camera gradually pulls back to reveal more\n  • Pan (摇镜头): Camera moves horizontally left/right\n  • Tilt (俯仰): Camera moves vertically up/down\n  • Dolly (推拉): Camera moves forward/backward on a track\n  • Orbit (环绕): Camera circles around the subject\n  • Crane (升降): Camera rises or descends vertically\n  • Handheld (手持): Natural camera shake for documentary feel\n  • Static (固定): No camera movement\n\n  组合示例: Camera slowly orbits around the subject from right to left,\n           with a gentle upward tilt, creating a dynamic perspective shift.\n\n【质量控制参数】\n  • 分辨率: 1344x768 (0.98MP, 16:9) — 可调\n  • 帧数: 124帧 ≈ 5秒 (24fps, 步进17, 格式 17k+5)\n  • 采样器: res_multistep (H3专用)\n  • 调度器: simple, 20步, denoise=1.0\n  • SigmaShift: video=12.0, audio=3.0 (默认值)\n\n【帧数对照表 (24fps, 17k+5网格)】\n  • 5秒: 124帧 (默认, 训练范围内)\n  • 10秒: 245帧\n  • 15秒: 362帧 (训练范围上限)\n\n【分辨率对照表 (16:9)】\n  • 0.4MP: 864x480 (快速测试)\n  • 0.6MP: 1056x608\n  • 0.98MP: 1344x768 (默认, 推荐)\n  • 2.0MP: 1920x1088 (高画质, 需更多显存)\n\n【模型文件 (HuggingFace: Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3)】\n  DiT: minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors (diffusion_models/)\n  CLIP: qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors (text_encoders/)\n  Video VAE: minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors (vae/)\n  Audio VAE: minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors (vae/)\n\n【使用步骤】\n  1. 下载所需模型文件到对应目录\n  2. 上传首帧图片到 LoadImage(首帧) 节点\n  3. 上传尾帧图片到 LoadImage(尾帧) 节点\n  4. 编辑提示词: 修改 Scene、Camera、Audio 段落\n  5. 调整分辨率和帧数 (如需要)\n  6. Queue Prompt 生成视频\n\n【提示词结构】\n  Scene: [场景过渡描述]\n  Camera: [运镜描述]\n  Audio: [音频描述]\n\n【技术要点】\n  • H3 的 LATENT 是 NestedTensor (video + audio 联合潜空间)\n  • VAEDecode 解码视频部分, VAEDecodeAudio 解码音频部分\n  • CreateVideo 合并 IMAGE + AUDIO → VIDEO 类型\n  • SaveVideo 保存为带音轨的视频文件\n  • BasicGuider 仅用正面条件 (H3 是 flow-matching 模型, 无需 CFG)"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "title": "★ MiniMax H3 FLF2V 工作流", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335577", "size": [560, 700], "pos": [20, 20], "id": 1, "properties": {}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "slot_index": 0, "links": [1], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "links": [], "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "color": "#332", "widgets_values": ["first_frame.jpg", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "图像", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "选择文件上传", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "type": "LoadImage", "title": "🎬 首帧 (First Frame)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#553", "size": [320, 340], "pos": [20, 780], "id": 2, "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "slot_index": 0, "links": [2], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "links": [], "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "color": "#332", "widgets_values": ["last_frame.jpg", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "图像", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "选择文件上传", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "type": "LoadImage", "title": "🎬 尾帧 (Last Frame)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#553", "size": [320, 340], "pos": [20, 1160], "id": 3, "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 2}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [3], "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": ["A cinematic shot transitioning smoothly from the first frame to the last frame.\n\nScene: The scene evolves naturally between the two keyframes with realistic physics, lighting, and environmental motion. The subject's pose and expression transition smoothly from the first frame to the last frame.\n\nCamera: The camera slowly orbits around the subject from right to left, with a gentle upward tilt, creating a dynamic perspective shift. The movement is smooth and cinematic, spanning the entire duration.\n\nAudio: Natural ambient sounds matching the environment, with subtle audio transitions that complement the visual movement."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "值", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "✏️ 提示词 (含运镜控制: Scene + Camera + Audio)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [560, 220], "pos": [20, 1540], "id": 4, "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "slot_index": 0, "links": [8], "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "unet_name"}, "name": "unet_name", "label": "UNET名称", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "UNET名称"}, {"widget": {"name": "weight_dtype"}, "name": "weight_dtype", "label": "权重类型", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "权重类型"}], "flags": {}, "type": "UNETLoader", "title": "DiT 模型 (MiniMax H3 FL2VA)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [380, 100], "pos": [620, 780], "id": 5, "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "UNETLoader"}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CLIP", "slot_index": 0, "links": [4], "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "CLIP"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors", "minimax", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "clip_name"}, "name": "clip_name",